[{"type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"\u003c@U025UTETFDJ\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1624280349.054300","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"16ff17bd-3802-433c-94bc-5ae5d42eac21","type":"message","user":"URAM81C5D","text":"ファイラーはnerdtreeとuniteだけですね…\nコメントアウトしてみましたがダメでした\n\n\u0026gt; やはり、aleと必要なシンタックス系のプラグインだけを使う、最小のvimrcを用意して切り分けがよいと思います\n地道に探してみるしかないですよね…ありがとうございます","ts":"1624280262.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sjy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A8D7E836-E50E-4EC9-A2EF-E6692BDF22EA","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"やはり、aleと必要なシンタックス系のプラグインだけを使う、最小のvimrcを用意して切り分けがよいと思います","ts":"1624280215.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XMfo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9C351FC2-3623-481E-BD0C-79F1D0F92684","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"カレントフォルダのファイルツリーみたいなのがフォーマットの祭にでてるのでファイラー系とかも怪しいですね","ts":"1624279893.050000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ST="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ab29c4b-8e4a-44e5-be97-231827b5455d","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"\u0026gt; aleが異常に重いとき\nLSP以外に、影響する・影響を受けるプラグインは多いです。\nWindows10 + NeoVimだと裏で走ってるコマンドラインからの戻り値のパースに失敗して死ぬとか、あります。","ts":"1624279893.049900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wxJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbdb204d-8aa7-4a89-9847-d685f5339c55","type":"message","user":"URAM81C5D","text":"\u003c@U78A6ESHM\u003e\nだめでした…\n\njsに該当するプラグインをコメントアウトして実行してみたんですが、挙動は変わらず…といった感じです","ts":"1624279791.046100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"edfL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E137DC17-5D33-4EAC-B3D5-7EA1F1775C4F","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"沢山、他にもプラグイン入ってそうですね。再現する最小のvimrcを用意して切り分けていったほうが良いかもしれませんね。。","ts":"1624279557.042300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tOK5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"480e5573-51a1-414e-80ed-845f26f48811","type":"message","user":"URAM81C5D","text":"試してみます！","ts":"1624279304.038000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WNUKj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26dd0f3e-6d3e-443d-869d-fba568ca7049","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"外してるかもしれませんが、\n```  let g:ale_fixers = {\n  \\   '*': ['remove_trailing_lines', 'trim_whitespace'],\n  \\   'ruby': ['rubocop'],\n  \\   'javascript': ['prettier'],\n  \\   'typescript': ['prettier'],\n  \\   'typescriptreact': ['prettier'],\n  \\}```\nでいかがでしょうか？自分の環境では `'typescriptreact': ['prettier'],` 追加で整形してくれました。","ts":"1624278929.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GBELZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51f5f47a-ff68-46ef-b0b8-cd57ec6b2113","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なにこれすごい…","ts":"1624278056.036500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rmgU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94317781-8dfb-4763-979a-10c3505fa420","type":"message","user":"URAM81C5D","text":"因みにvimrcのale設定部分は以下です\n```\n  \" linter\n  call dein#add('dense-analysis/ale')\n  \" エラーシンボル変更・シンボルカラムを常に表示\n  let g:ale_sign_error = 'E'\n  let g:ale_sign_warning = 'W'\n  let g:ale_sign_column_always = 1\n\n  \" ステータスラインの変更\n  let g:ale_statusline_format = ['⨉ %d', '⚠ %d', '⬥ ok']\n\n  \" メッセージのフォーマット変更\n  let g:ale_echo_msg_error_str = 'E'\n  let g:ale_echo_msg_warning_str = 'W'\n  let g:ale_echo_msg_format = '[%linter%] %s [%severity%]'\n\n  let g:ale_lint_on_enter = 0 \" ファイルオープン時のチェックなし\n  let g:ale_lint_on_save = 1\n  let g:ale_linters_explicit = 1\n  let g:ale_linters = {\n  \\   'ruby': ['rubocop'],\n  \\   'json': ['jsonlint'],\n  \\   'javascript': ['prettier', 'eslint'],\n  \\   'typescript': ['prettier', 'eslint'],\n  \\}\n  let g:ale_fixers = {\n  \\   '*': ['remove_trailing_lines', 'trim_whitespace'],\n  \\   'ruby': ['rubocop'],\n  \\   'javascript': ['prettier'],\n  \\   'typescript': ['prettier'],\n  \\}\n  let g:ale_ruby_rubocop_executable = 'rubocop-daemon-wrapper'\n  let g:ale_javascript_prettier_options = '--single-quote --trailing-comma all'\n  let g:ale_javascript_prettier_use_local_config = 1\n  \" ale on off switch nnoremap\n  nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;leader\u0026gt;json \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(ale_toggle)\n  \" エラー間の移動\n  nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(ale_previous_wrap)\n  nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(aple_next_wrap)\n  \" ALEFixの実行\n  nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;leader\u0026gt;af :ALEFix\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n  \" ALELintの実行\n  nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;leader\u0026gt;al :ALELint\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```","ts":"1624277942.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W4nF6"}]},{"type":"message","user":"URAM81C5D","text":"aleが謎の挙動をするのでどなたかお助けください\njs/jsx/ts/tsxファイルをいじって、prettierをかけると何故かファイル名がファイルのトップに挿入されます（gifの通り）\n特にまずい設定を行っているわけではないのですが…謎の挙動が直らないためvim-prettierを代用してる次第です。\nあとlspの影響かもしれませんが、aleが異常に重いときがあります…（これも可能ならどうにかしたい）","ts":"1624277893.035800","files":[{"id":"F025V1JHZK6","created":1624277883,"timestamp":1624277883,"name":"Peek 2021-06-21 21-11.gif","title":"Peek 2021-06-21 21-11.gif","mimetype":"image/gif","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"gif","pretty_type":"GIF","user":"URAM81C5D","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":461332,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F025V1JHZK6/peek_2021-06-21_21-11.gif","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/fil